<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Votre code de connexion — Pavillon Les Lys</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background-color: #F5F0E8; color: #000000; }
        .wrapper { background-color: #F5F0E8; padding: 40px 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #FDFAF5; border: 0.5px solid rgba(201,161,74,0.2); border-radius: 0; overflow: hidden; border-top: 2px solid #B89140; }
        .header { text-align: center; padding: 40px 48px 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,161,74,0.2); }
        .logo-eyebrow { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.4em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #A97C50; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .logo-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000000; }
        .header-divider { width: 40px; height: 1px; background: #B89140; margin: 16px auto 0; }
        .body { padding: 40px 48px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 16px; color: #000000; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .intro-text { font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F4E; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 36px; }
        .otp-box { background: #F5F0E8; border: 0.5px solid #B89140; border-radius: 0; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .otp-label { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #B89140; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .otp-code { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 20px; color: #B89140; padding-right: 20px; }
        .otp-expiry { font-size: 12px; color: #A97C50; margin-top: 14px; }
        .security-note { background: #F5F0E8; border-left: 2px solid #71603F; border-radius: 0; padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
        .security-note p { font-size: 13px; color: #6B5F4E; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer-text { font-size: 13px; color: #6B5F4E; line-height: 1.7; }
        .footer { background-color: #FDFAF5; padding: 24px 48px; border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(113,96,63,0.2); text-align: center; }
        .footer p { font-size: 11px; color: #A97C50; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer a { color: #B89140; text-decoration: none; }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .header, .body, .footer { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
            .otp-code { font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: 14px; padding-right: 14px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <p class="logo-eyebrow">Prestige &amp; Élégance</p>
                <h1 class="logo-title">Pavillon Les Lys</h1>
                <div class="header-divider"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
                <p class="greeting">Bonjour {{firstName}},</p>
                <p class="intro-text">
                    Voici votre code de connexion à usage unique. Saisissez-le pour
                    finaliser votre première connexion à votre espace personnel Pavillon Les Lys.
                </p>
                <div class="otp-box">
                    <p class="otp-label">Votre code</p>
                    <p class="otp-code">{{otpCode}}</p>
                    <p class="otp-expiry">Ce code expire dans {{expiresIn}}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="security-note">
                    <p>
                        Si vous n’êtes pas à l’origine de cette demande, ignorez
                        simplement cet email. Votre compte reste sécurisé.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="footer-text">
                    Cordialement,<br />
                    L’équipe Pavillon Les Lys
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p>© {{year}} Pavillon Les Lys — Tous droits réservés</p>
                <p style="margin-top:6px;">Ne répondez pas à cet email —
                    <a href="mailto:contact@pavillonleslys.fr">contact@pavillonleslys.fr</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
